1
00:00:03,904 --> 00:00:05,854
(Howard:)I'm thinking about growing a goatee.

2
00:00:06,139 --> 00:00:09,249
(Raj:)Actually that's a Van Dyke.
A goatee is just hair on the chin.

3
00:00:09,643 --> 00:00:12,353
Oh. Wait, than what is it
if you just have hair up here?

4
00:00:12,513 --> 00:00:13,513
You mean a mustache?

5
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:14,920
-Moo-stache!
-(SHOUTS) He said it!

6
00:00:15,582 --> 00:00:17,892
(Raj:)Ha-ha, very funny.
Make fun of the foreign guy.

7
00:00:18,018 --> 00:00:20,358
(Raj:)For your information,
there are four times as many Indians

8
00:00:20,521 --> 00:00:22,431
(Raj:)as there are Americans,
so the way we say it is right.

9
00:00:22,589 --> 00:00:23,829
(Howard:)-Say what?
-Moo-stache.

10
00:00:23,991 --> 00:00:25,731
-(SHOUTS) Moo-stache!
-He said "moo-stache".

11
00:00:26,927 --> 00:00:28,267
(Bernadette:)Guys, you're being childish.

12
00:00:28,428 --> 00:00:31,568
(Sheldon:)She's right. You're grown men,
the kind who are perfectly capable

13
00:00:31,732 --> 00:00:33,442
(Sheldon:)of growing your own moo-staches.

14
00:00:35,335 --> 00:00:38,005
(Amy:)Hey, you were funny
on purpose, good job.

15
00:00:39,606 --> 00:00:41,606
(Penny:)Hi. Sorry I'm late.
I was at an audition.

16
00:00:42,209 --> 00:00:43,949
(Leonard:)-I'm sorry.
-You'll get 'em next time.

17
00:00:45,612 --> 00:00:49,222
(Penny:)How about instead of assuming I
failed, you ask me how it went?

18
00:00:49,283 --> 00:00:50,763
(Leonard:)Sorry. How did it go?

19
00:00:50,918 --> 00:00:52,368
(Penny:)Just shut up.

20
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,120
(Raj:)Here, you can have your seat.

21
00:00:54,288 --> 00:00:56,238
(Penny:)No, no, stay there.
I'm fine on the floor.

22
00:00:56,924 --> 00:00:59,304
(Bernadette:)Have you guys ever thought about
getting a dining room table?

23
00:00:59,459 --> 00:01:02,019
(Amy:)Yeah. You actually do have
room for one up there.

